{"title":"Career Roadmap · Federation Legal Officer","role":"Federation Legal Officer","summary":"A Federation Legal Officer provides legal and regulatory support to a sports federation, association, league, governing body or sports organization.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Sports Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Federation Legal Officer provides legal and regulatory support to a sports federation, association, league, governing body or sports organization."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines sports law, governance, contracts, disciplinary procedures, athlete rights, regulatory compliance and dispute resolution."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal research and advice"},{"text":"Federation governance"},{"text":"Drafting and reviewing contracts"},{"text":"Athlete and player agreements"},{"text":"Sponsorship agreements"},{"text":"Vendor and service contracts"},{"text":"Tournament regulations"},{"text":"Disciplinary matters"},{"text":"Eligibility disputes"},{"text":"Selection-related legal issues"},{"text":"Anti-doping compliance support"},{"text":"Safeguarding and athlete-protection policies"},{"text":"Intellectual property and broadcasting rights"},{"text":"Sports disputes and arbitration"},{"text":"Regulatory correspondence"},{"text":"Legal documentation"},{"text":"Coordination with external counsel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role is particularly suitable for students who want to combine law + sports administration + governance."},{"type":"note","label":"Professional qualification note","text":"“Federation Legal Officer” is an organizational employment designation rather than a uniformly regulated profession. Where the work involves independent legal practice, representation or advocacy, applicable professional requirements must be 